{
  "description": "The CNA C ABI structures the WebAssembly backend writes and reads. wasm32 layouts differ from the native ones -- pointers are four bytes -- so they are measured from a compiled Emscripten probe rather than copied from the native ABI baseline, which is exactly the mistake docs/c-api/WASM_ARTIFACT.md warns a binding will make.",
